#! rate=44118 block=128 tracks=4
# 13 Scenes and song (R11). `song <s>` starts a new song from scene s and
# launches it (Movy's scene press); `songadd` appends. A scene lasts its
# longest clip rounded up to whole bars; the next scene is armed a bar early;
# a repeated scene is one entry and is not relaunched; an empty scene stops
# every track and ends the song while the transport runs on. Play restarts
# the song from its first entry.
# Scene 0: track 0 a bar, track 1 half a bar. Scene 1: track 0 only.
@0 tog 0 0 60 100
@0 tog 0 8 62 100
@0 tog 1 0 48 100
@0 clen 1 8
@0 clipsel 0 1
@0 tog 0 0 67 100
@0 clen 0 4
@0 clipsel 0 0
@0 song 0
@0 songadd 0
@0 songadd 1
@0 songadd 2
@360000 play
@380000 stop
